{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id371497961"}, "name":{"label":"Aussie bad kitty"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-12-13T00:43:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.77.0"}, "id":{"label":"10688961403"}, "title":{"label":"The App that finally did it"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve tried several “ Water Tracking Apps “ before and they all failed to get me to drink enough water. The incentive just wasn’t there…. The ones with the plant that died if you don’t drink enough made me feel guilty about it but I still didn’t drink enough. I hate plain water \nThis app is different…it allows you to log EVERYTHING you drink..and shows you just how hydrating the different drinks are. The character are cute and fun. The challenges really make you focus on your health and are also fun to do.\nWater Lama not only got me to drink more water but also less coffee and soft drinks as you can see via the different colours just what you have consumed. I love this app so much I purchased the Lifetime subscription", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
