{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id16792184"}, "name":{"label":"Nathan#95"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-11-20T22:35:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.76.1"}, "id":{"label":"10607986439"}, "title":{"label":"Amazing, but would love to see some additions"}, "content":{"label":"Overall, I love this app. It’s the water reminding app I’ll continue using, but I’d love to see some additions to complete the experience.\n\nFirst and foremost, Siri integration. Logging with Siri, Shortcut/automation support.\nLooking at drinks history, would be great if I could tap on a drink and get a prompt to delete, forgoing the need to open up another menu. Or the classic swipe to delete. \nSwipe back (as in front left edge) or pull down to exit menus, so stretching up to the X isn’t necessary.\nDark mode, with device matching.\nFor Watch app, ability to delete previous entities. Tap on item in history, popup with confirm delete. \nAbbreviated settings menu for Watch, including: reminders (on/off, off for rest of day), change Home Screen.\nFor Watch, option to set how long it takes to revert after tapping on face to reveal remaining %, or even an option to make it a toggle instead of the timed, automatic reset. Not sure if it’s possible for WatchOS, but being able to show the values as long as I press on the screen would be clean, hiding when I release.\nOption to change complication icon on Watch (to a droplet, for example). The characters don’t always translate well when they’re so small. Perhaps even ability to choose what is displayed on complications - instead of icon, show a value, like amount remaining, amount drunk, percentage remaining, percentage completed. Choose complication colours? \nCan’t really think of any others at the moment. I love this app, please don’t let this feedback indicate otherwise! I’m hopeful though that sometime soon some of these can be improved upon to make the app even better :)\n\nThanks for your hard work in creating an effective yet characterful app!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
